{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 12,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 321.146,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.106,
      "end": 4.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look, and behold thy seed,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.097,
      "end": 7.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the seed of thy brethren.",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 7.413,
      "end": 10.246,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld the land of promise;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.426,
      "end": 12.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld multitudes of people,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.021,
      "end": 16.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even as it were in number as many as the sand of the sea.",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.463,
      "end": 20.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld multitudes",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.522,
      "end": 22.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "gathered together to battle,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 22.745,
      "end": 24.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "one against the other;",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 24.318,
      "end": 25.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld wars,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 26.077,
      "end": 27.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rumors of wars,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 27.79,
      "end": 31.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great slaughters with the sword among my people.",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 31.953,
      "end": 40.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld many generations pass away, after the manner of wars and contentions in the land;",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.724,
      "end": 43.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld many cities,",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.18,
      "end": 45.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even that I did not number them.",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.507,
      "end": 51.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw a mist of darkness on the face of the land of promise;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 52.167,
      "end": 53.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw lightnings,",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 53.972,
      "end": 59.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I heard thunderings, and earthquakes, and all manner of tumultuous noises;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 59.353,
      "end": 62.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw the earth and the rocks, that they rent;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 62.784,
      "end": 65.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw mountains tumbling into pieces;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 65.983,
      "end": 68.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw the plains of the earth,",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 68.392,
      "end": 70.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were broken up;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 70.197,
      "end": 72.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw many cities that they were sunk;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 73.163,
      "end": 76.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw many that they were burned with fire;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 76.501,
      "end": 81.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw many that did tumble to the earth, because of the quaking thereof.",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 81.732,
      "end": 84.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after I saw these things,",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 84.791,
      "end": 86.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I saw the vapor of darkness,",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 87.014,
      "end": 89.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it passed from off the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 90.073,
      "end": 96.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, I saw multitudes who had not fallen because of the great and terrible judgments of the Lord.",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 96.976,
      "end": 98.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I saw the heavens open,",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 98.967,
      "end": 101.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamb of God descending out of heaven;",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 102.119,
      "end": 105.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he came down and showed himself unto them.",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 105.91,
      "end": 108.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also saw and bear record",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 108.366,
      "end": 111.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Holy Ghost fell upon twelve others;",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 111.472,
      "end": 114.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were ordained of God, and chosen.",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 114.985,
      "end": 117.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 117.533,
      "end": 121.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the twelve disciples of the Lamb, who are chosen to minister unto thy seed.",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 122.671,
      "end": 124.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 124.291,
      "end": 127.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou rememberest the twelve apostles of the Lamb?",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 127.536,
      "end": 131.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold they are they who shall judge the twelve tribes of Israel;",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 131.803,
      "end": 135.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the twelve ministers of thy seed shall be judged of them;",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 136.163,
      "end": 138.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 139.351,
      "end": 144.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these twelve ministers whom thou beholdest shall judge thy seed.",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.686,
      "end": 147.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And, behold, they are righteous forever;",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 147.606,
      "end": 150.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for because of their faith in the Lamb of God",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 150.805,
      "end": 153.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their garments are made white in his blood.",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 154.364,
      "end": 155.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 156.077,
      "end": 156.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 157.046,
      "end": 161.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked, and beheld three generations pass away in righteousness;",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 161.87,
      "end": 163.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their garments were white",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 163.908,
      "end": 166.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even like unto the Lamb of God.",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 166.271,
      "end": 167.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 167.984,
      "end": 172.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "These are made white in the blood of the Lamb, because of their faith in him.",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.704,
      "end": 177.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, also saw many of the fourth generation who passed away in righteousness.",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 178.028,
      "end": 183.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw the multitudes of the earth gathered together.",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 183.816,
      "end": 185.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 185.529,
      "end": 188.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold thy seed, and also the seed of thy brethren.",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 189.646,
      "end": 191.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I looked",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 192.102,
      "end": 194.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and beheld the people of my seed",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 194.743,
      "end": 199.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "gathered together in multitudes against the seed of my brethren;",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 199.288,
      "end": 201.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were gathered together to battle.",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 202.383,
      "end": 204.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 204.931,
      "end": 208.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the fountain of filthy water which thy father saw;",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 208.408,
      "end": 210.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the river of which he spake;",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 211.142,
      "end": 214.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the depths thereof are the depths of hell.",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 214.887,
      "end": 216.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the mists of darkness",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 216.971,
      "end": 219.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are the temptations of the devil,",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 219.566,
      "end": 221.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which blindeth the eyes,",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 221.279,
      "end": 224.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hardeneth the hearts of the children of men,",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 224.663,
      "end": 227.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and leadeth them away into broad roads,",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 227.397,
      "end": 229.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they perish and are lost.",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 230.027,
      "end": 232.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the large and spacious building,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 232.436,
      "end": 235.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thy father saw, is vain imaginations",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 235.96,
      "end": 238.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the pride of the children of men.",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 238.648,
      "end": 241.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And a great and a terrible gulf divideth them;",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 241.847,
      "end": 245.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the word of the justice of the Eternal God,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 245.696,
      "end": 248.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Messiah who is the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 248.244,
      "end": 254.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of whom the Holy Ghost beareth record, from the beginning of the world until this time,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 254.508,
      "end": 257.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from this time henceforth and forever.",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 258.067,
      "end": 260.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And while the angel spake these words,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 260.615,
      "end": 268.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld and saw that the seed of my brethren did contend against my seed, according to the word of the angel;",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 268.736,
      "end": 270.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of the pride of my seed,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 271.099,
      "end": 273.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the temptations of the devil,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 273.647,
      "end": 278.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld that the seed of my brethren did overpower the people of my seed.",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 278.832,
      "end": 281.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld,",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 281.38,
      "end": 284.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and saw the people of the seed of my brethren",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 284.857,
      "end": 287.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they had overcome my seed;",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 287.684,
      "end": 291.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went forth in multitudes upon the face of the land.",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 292.079,
      "end": 295.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I saw them gathered together in multitudes;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 295.278,
      "end": 298.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw wars and rumors of wars among them;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 298.755,
      "end": 302.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in wars and rumors of wars I saw many generations pass away.",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 303.429,
      "end": 304.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 305.142,
      "end": 307.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold these shall dwindle in unbelief.",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 308.237,
      "end": 310.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld,",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 310.785,
      "end": 313.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after they had dwindled in unbelief",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 313.241,
      "end": 316.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they became a dark, and loathsome, and a filthy people,",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 317.09,
      "end": 320.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "full of idleness and all manner of abominations.",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    }
  ]
}